## Test: Method Return
## Purpose: Return a value from a method using reflect.
## Expected: Method invocation returns 101 (visible in interpreter trace for invoke).

mind MethodReturn
awake
persona Student <<
    count id;
    interpret get_id() yields count <<
        reflect id;
    >>
>>
Student s1;
set s1.id -> 101;
invoke s1.get_id();
sleep;
